  <trk>
    <name>S:t Olofsleden Gotland</name>
    <desc>Welcome to a day or multi-day route in the footsteps of King Olof, across Gotland, through forests, alvar terrain, meadows, and fields. Several medieval churches are passed along the route. </desc>
